From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kevin Turcios <turcioskevinr@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 01:11:01 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Find distlib's Windows launchers in the compiled kpip

distlib.scripts reads its launchers on Windows when it is imported,
through a resource finder chosen by the type of its package's loader, and
knows only the standard library's loaders. The compiled kpip's modules
have Nuitka's, so importing it failed with "Unable to locate finder", and
every install with it. Register distlib's file system finder for whatever
loads its package: the launchers are files in the package's directory in
the compiled kpip as they are from source.
---
